@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 04. Refund / Withdrawal Process

|Student (App/Web)|
start
:Submit Request;
note right: Includes Reason, Amount, \nand Payout Info

|Accountant|
:Review Eligibility & Policy;
if (Approved?) then (No)
  :Reject with Reason;
else (Yes)
  :Confirm Payout Details;

  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Hold Funds in Wallet;

  |Payment Gateway|
  :Process Payout;
  note right
    If Gateway fails or rejects,
    funds are released and
    status is set to FAILED.
  end note

  |Internal Wallet System|
  if (Transaction Successful?) then (Yes)
    :Debit Held Funds;
    :Update Status to SUCCESS;
  else (No)
    :Release Held Funds;
    :Update Status to FAILED;
  endif

  |Accountant|
  :Send Final Notification;
endif

|Student (App/Web)|
:View Updated Balance & History;
stop
@enduml